      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUMOUR STRIDE (3) scored a game win two runs back over 1609m at Newcastle, then last start finished fourth over 1609m at Menangle, beaten 18 metres after locking wheels with a rival runner in the run home.  A nice draw on the front line should ensure a soft trip in the running and she is a leading chance if she is at her best. VIN NUMBER (8) after getting caught out wide in the early running went forward to find the front and fought on well to the line to score as the $2.70 favourite over 1710m at Goulburn eight days ago. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Big chance in a similar race. GUILTY PARTY (10) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by 6 metres at Riverina Paceway over 2270m. after he came from well back in the running into the turn. CARBINEER (7) is the next elect off a last-start win by 3.5 metres at this track over 1770m which made it two wins from three starts here.",
